  "id": "sociometric-status",
  "term": "sociometric status",
  "definition": "Sociometric status is a person’s level of acceptance or rejection by peers within a group. It is commonly assessed by asking group members whom they would or would not choose for a particular activity, with status reflected in how many peers accept or reject that person.",
